Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Removes the value again. The driver falls back to its default (no legacy
; sharpening option) on the next boot.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services
vlddmkm\Parameters\FTS]
"EnableGR535"=-

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services
vlddmkm\FTS]
"EnableGR535"=-
